  "reference": "Judges 17",
  "verseCount": 13,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "17",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JDG 17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "17",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And there was a man of the hill-country of Ephraim, whose name was Micah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he said unto his mother, The eleven hundred ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " of silver that were taken from thee, about which thou didst utter a curse, and didst also speak it in mine ears, behold, the silver is with me; I took it. And his mother said, Blessed be my son of Jehovah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he restored the eleven hundred ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " of silver to his mother; and his mother said, I verily dedicate the silver unto Jehovah from my hand for my son, to make a graven image and a molten image: now therefore I will restore it unto thee. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And when he restored the money unto his mother, his mother took two hundred ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " of silver, and gave them to the founder, who made thereof a graven image and a molten image: and it was in the house of Micah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the man Micah had a house of gods, and he made an ephod, and teraphim, and consecrated one of his sons, who became his priest. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In those days there was no king in Israel: every man did that which was right in his own eyes.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And there was a young man out of Beth-lehem-judah, of the family of Judah, who was a Levite; and he sojourned there. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the man departed out of the city, out of Beth-lehem-judah, to sojourn where he could find ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", and he came to the hill-country of Ephraim to the house of Micah, as he journeyed. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Micah said unto him, Whence comest thou? And he said unto him, I am a Levite of Beth-lehem-judah, and I go to sojourn where I may find ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Micah said unto him, Dwell with me, and be unto me a father and a priest, and I will give thee ten ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " of silver by the year, and a suit of apparel, and thy victuals. So the Levite went in. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the Levite was content to dwell with the man; and the young man was unto him as one of his sons. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Micah consecrated the Levite, and the young man became his priest, and was in the house of Micah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then said Micah, Now know I that Jehovah will do me good, seeing I have a Levite to my priest.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "JDG.18",
    "number": "18",
    "bookId": "JDG"
  },
